Default Unicode Collation Element Table (DUCET)
===============================================

The file `allkeys.txt` in this directory is the Default Unicode Collation
Element Table, version 15.1.0, obtained from:

    https://www.unicode.org/Public/UCA/15.1.0/allkeys.txt

It is Copyright (c) 2023 Unicode, Inc. and is used under the Unicode Terms of
Use: https://www.unicode.org/terms_of_use.html

`ducet_data.c` is generated from `allkeys.txt` by `gen_ducet.py` and is a
mechanical transformation of that data; the same Unicode Terms of Use apply.

